<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 282 0 R
/T (Career Passport is a 90-minute mentoring session at the IEEE MTT-S BPC Workshop in Montevideo, where students and early-career engineers rotate through 4 small tables hosted by senior MTT-S members and collect a stamp at each one.)
/E (Career Passport is a 90-minute mentoring session at the IEEE MTT-S BPC Workshop in Montevideo, where students and early-career engineers rotate through 4 small tables hosted by senior MTT-S members and collect a stamp at each one.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
428 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 282 0 R
/T (Mentors stamp the passport only after a real question, so every stop turns into an actual conversation. We close with one-sentence takeaways from attendees, a wisdom wall, a raffle for full passports and a group photo. The idea is simple: give participants, many of them from smaller universities and attending an IEEE event for the first time, an easy way to talk face to face with people they usually only see on stage.)
/E (Mentors stamp the passport only after a real question, so every stop turns into an actual conversation. We close with one-sentence takeaways from attendees, a wisdom wall, a raffle for full passports and a group photo. The idea is simple: give participants, many of them from smaller universities and attending an IEEE event for the first time, an easy way to talk face to face with people they usually only see on stage.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
